/**

@page swift_benchmarks Benchmarks

\li \subpage benchmarks_swift_particle_orbit_benchmark
\li \subpage benchmarks_swift_sod_1d_benchmark

Swift comes along with a set of benchmarks. 
These can be found under `/benchmarks/swift2/hydro`
and should all run out-of-the-box via the provided `run.sh` scripts.
Before you start, ensure that you have configured and built Peano as specified
for @ref swift_home "Swift".
Notice that some of these will use HDF5 files and hence require the correponding
configuration for Peano.


